==English==

===Etymology===
{{term|ass}} + {{term|wipe}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{vulgar}} An [[annoying]], [[contemptible]], or [[worthless]] person.
#: ''He is such an '''asswipe'''!''
# {{rfv-sense}} {{British|informal|vulgar}} [[toilet paper|Toilet paper]] (or something used in its place to wipe one's anus after defecation).
#: ''Pass me the '''asswipes''', John.''
# {{figuratively}} A [[periodical]] which has the habit of publishing questionable truths.
#: ''Our local paper is an '''asswipe'''''.

====Synonyms====
*Something used to wipe one's anus after defecation : [[wipebreech]], [[torchecul]], [[arsewisp]], [[bumfodder]], [[tail-napkin]], [[bunghole cleanser]], [[wipe-breech]]

